<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK MKTS CLOSED FRI, MON FOR EASTER.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK MKTS CLOSED FRI, MON FOR EASTER.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Markets in Slovakia will be closed on Friday, March 28 and Monday, March 31 as the country observes the Easter holiday.</p>
<p>Markets will re-open at their regular hours on Tuesday, April 1.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
